    "detailed_description": "This game includes duels with 20 enemy chieftains. The game mainly consists of two gameplay modes: chief duel and map exploration.<br><br>Chief Duel gameplay:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595960/extras/fbc9c6291cced4457f612d93a73080fa.poster.avif?t=1732125433\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595960/extras/fbc9c6291cced4457f612d93a73080fa.webm?t=1732125433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595960/extras/fbc9c6291cced4457f612d93a73080fa.mp4?t=1732125433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>1. The operation is simple and crude, all you need is your hands. There\u2019s no crazy list of moves, even if you don\u2019t know them all. You can still play by left-clicking to attack and right-clicking to defend and shift to dodge.<br>2. The enemies are extremely powerful and shocking. But as you gradually learn and master the game mechanics, become familiar with the enemy's routines and AI, and use skills and items rationally, you will become extremely powerful and shocking too.<br><br>Map adventure gameplay:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595960/extras/4f25308af5b073280ed66223abde7813.avif?t=1732125433\" width=600 height=598 /></span><br>1. Before dueling with the chief, you will have the opportunity to collect food on the map. Food can temporarily increase your ability during a duel.<br>2. There are 4 pieces of food in each map. It is very difficult to collect them all. If you are a brave and reckless person, you can also choose to ignore the food and go straight to it!<br><br>This is an individual game developed with limited resources. There is no complicated world view setting, no red tape plot, and no annoying level design, just go for the boss and fight!<br>Fight! Cool! Die! Fight Again! Cut off the enemy's head!",
